{"unit_id":"GHJIVHIDD__dsh-plugin-session-terminal#card-zh","repo":"GHJIVHIDD/dsh-plugin-session-terminal","commit":"d22004e129df8606d05c8021e497fe567aa85c04","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Session Terminal 是面向 DSH Web 的会话终端观察插件。它在会话视图中加入「终端」页签，并读取当前会话的已完成与运行中 bash 调用。用户可以查看命令、工作目录、状态、开始时间、耗时及输出，展开结果并清除当前显示记录；列表会在用户停留底部时自动跟随新记录。适合需要在对话界面追踪命令执行过程的 DSH Web 用户。清除标记保存在浏览器本地存储中，需要 DSH Web 会话运行时。","source":"generated","evidence":["dsh-plugin-session-terminal/src/client.js:215-311"]}
{"unit_id":"GHJIVHIDD__dsh-plugin-session-terminal#card-en","repo":"GHJIVHIDD/dsh-plugin-session-terminal","commit":"d22004e129df8606d05c8021e497fe567aa85c04","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Session Terminal adds a Terminal tab to DSH Web conversations and reads this session’s running and completed bash calls. It shows commands, status, working directories, duration, and output, with expandable results and a clear action. The clear marker is saved in browser local storage.","source":"generated","evidence":["dsh-plugin-session-terminal/src/client.js:215-311"]}
